The container image of Espalier installs the Debian package ffmpeg
(FFmpeg, https://ffmpeg.org/), which Debian builds with GPL components.
Espalier starts ffmpeg and ffprobe as separate programs and links none of
their code. Debian publishes the source of the package at
https://sources.debian.org/src/ffmpeg/, and /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg/copyright
in the image holds its license terms.
